Second Session
One Discourse:
"Continuing the Way of Heaven and Establishing the Supreme Standard."
One Topic Chosen from Either Imperial Edict, Mandate, or Memorial:
Drafting an edict of the Han dynasty bestowing silk upon the Thrice Venerable, the Filial and Fraternal, and the Diligent Cultivators of the Fields;
Drafting a mandate of the Tang dynasty conferring upon Fang Xuanling 房玄齡 the title of Junior Preceptor of the Heir Apparent;
Drafting a memorial of the Tang dynasty by Yu Shinan 虞世南 presenting the Discourse on Sagely Virtue (Shengde lun).
Legal Judgments:
Fraudulently dispatching military conscripts;
Missing deadlines for autumn grain tax;
Violating regulations for clothing and dwellings;
Concealing households and population;
Inequitable assessment of taxes and corvée labor.

Third Session
Five Policy Questions:
